E=/home/user/Nicole-projects/elevenlabs
ST="Stylized 3D cartoon animation like a family animated feature film, cinematic horizontal 16:9 frame, soft rounded shapes, expressive faces. NOT realistic. No text or letters anywhere except the macaw's hat patch. The main action is in the CENTER third of the frame."
G="The young teenage cartoon macaw from the reference images, identical design: oversized head, big round glossy eyes, soft smooth feathers, rounded beak, red body, yellow and blue wings used like hands, the SAME beige bucket hat with the rectangular 'HONDURAS Secreta' patch."
M="Doña Marta exactly as in her reference sheet (55-year-old Honduran mother, gray-streaked hair in a low bun, floral blouse, light-blue apron)."
C="Carlos exactly as in his reference sheet (30-year-old Honduran man, short black hair, stubble, dark-blue puffer coat over a white cook jacket)."
B="The cardboard box exactly as in the prop reference (brown, tied with natural rope in a cross with a bow, no writing)."
R="--model gemini-3.1-flash-image --ar 16:9 --res 2K"
g(){ o=$1; shift; p=$1; shift; python3 $E/el.py image "$ST $p" -o sb_$o.png $R "$@" > sb_$o.log 2>&1; }
g 01 "Scene: a cold big city street at night with snow falling, warm streetlight. $C He walks alone home from work, stops under the streetlight and looks at a family photo on his phone screen (glow on his face), breath steaming, melancholic. Blue cold palette." --ref carlos_ref.png --ref style_humans.png &
g 02 "Scene: a humble Honduran village kitchen at sunrise in La Paz, clay pots, a wood stove, a window with mountains. $M She places an empty open cardboard box on the wooden table. $G The macaw has just landed on the window sill, adjusting his hat, looking at the box with a mischievous planning face. Warm golden palette." --ref marta_ref.png --ref jose_ref.png --ref jose_ref_close.png --ref caja_ref_c.png &
g 03 "Scene: a coffee farm in the green mountains of Marcala, Honduras, morning mist, red coffee cherries on bushes. A smiling cartoon farmer uncle in a straw hat hands a brown paper bag of freshly roasted coffee to the macaw. $G The macaw sniffs it with closed eyes and floats slightly off the ground, lifted by a visible swirl of coffee aroma, cartoon style." --ref jose_ref.png --ref jose_ref_close.png --ref style_humans.png &
g 04 "Scene: a small traditional Honduran bakery shop in Sabanagrande with trays and jars of rosquillas (small golden ring-shaped corn biscuits). A cartoon older lady with glasses puts rosquillas into a round metal tin. $G The macaw has secretly taken one rosquilla and holds it behind his back with an innocent guilty face, while the lady looks at him over her glasses with raised eyebrow. Comedic." --ref jose_ref.png --ref jose_ref_close.png --ref style_humans.png &
wait
g 05 "Scene: a colorful Honduran neighborhood street in the afternoon in front of a simple house. A happy family and neighbors pose together for a photo: $M in the center, a young university girl proudly holding up her student ID card, kids making funny faces, an old man. In the foreground, seen from behind and the side, $G the macaw holds an old vintage camera, the flash firing. Joyful." --ref marta_ref.png --ref jose_ref.png --ref style_humans.png &
g 06 "Scene: the same humble Honduran kitchen at night, warm lamp light. $M She sits at the wooden table recording a voice message on her phone held near her mouth, her other hand on her chest, emotional. On the table, the open cardboard box with a bag of coffee, a round tin of rosquillas, a printed family photo, and a nacatamal wrapped in green banana leaf. $G The macaw, on the table edge, gently ties the box with rope." --ref marta_ref.png --ref jose_ref.png --ref caja_ref_c.png &
g 07 "Scene: inside an airplane at night, window seat. $G The macaw sits buckled in the seat with the seatbelt, hugging the tied cardboard box on his lap, looking out the window with big hopeful eyes; outside the window dark clouds and the first snowflakes. $B Cold blue palette with a warm reading light." --ref jose_ref.png --ref jose_ref_close.png --ref caja_ref_c.png &
g 08 "Scene: an airport customs checkpoint. On the x-ray scanner screen the glowing silhouette of a wrapped rectangular tamal inside a box. A tall serious cartoon customs officer in a uniform (no badges or text) looks down suspiciously at the small macaw. $G The macaw stands on the counter next to the tied box, smiling innocently with one wing raised as if swearing. Comedic." --ref jose_ref.png --ref jose_ref_close.png --ref caja_ref_c.png &
wait
g 09 "Scene: the hallway of a modest apartment building at night, snow visible through a hallway window. $C He has just arrived, tired, and finds the tied cardboard box on the floor in front of his door, looking surprised. Through the snowy hallway window, the macaw peeks in secretly, half hidden. $G $B" --ref carlos_ref.png --ref jose_ref.png --ref caja_ref_c.png &
g 10 "Scene: a small, modest, cold blue-lit apartment at night, snow outside the window. $C He sits on the floor opening the cardboard box; warm golden light glows from inside the box onto his face. He holds the printed family photo, laughing and crying at the same time, one tear. Inside the box: bag of coffee, tin of rosquillas, nacatamal in banana leaf." --ref carlos_ref.png --ref caja_ref_c.png --ref style_humans.png &
g 11 "Scene: a humble Honduran kitchen at night on Christmas Eve, warm light, a simple Christmas nativity scene in the corner. $M She sits at the dining table set for dinner with nacatamales, next to an EMPTY chair with a served plate in front of it. She looks at the empty chair with love and quiet tears, hands together. Emotional, tender." --ref marta_ref.png --ref style_humans.png &
g 12 "Scene: the small apartment at night. $C He sits hugging the family photo to his chest with wet eyes and a grateful smile, an unwrapped nacatamal on a plate beside him. Outside the frosty window behind him, $G the macaw gives a wing thumbs-up before flying away into the falling snow; in the far distance, small colorful fireworks." --ref carlos_ref.png --ref jose_ref.png --ref jose_ref_close.png &
g 13 "Scene: a wide magical panoramic shot at night: $G the macaw flies away over a snowy city skyline toward the horizon where the sky turns warm golden, the silhouette of tropical Honduran mountains and palm trees faintly appearing on the horizon, a few fireworks. Lots of calm empty sky in the upper part of the frame for a closing message. Hopeful." --ref jose_ref.png --ref jose_ref_close.png &
wait
